  "title": "Restaurant-Style Beef and Broccoli",
  "description": "This beef and broccoli recipe with ginger and garlic is Chinese stir-fry food at its best. It's quick and easy to make and delicious served over rice.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
